      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, you're saying i should just take a break from zoloft? isn't that risky for my depression? i'm also kinda worried about the \"restless/wired\" feeling because i've also started feeling a bit sweaty and my heart is pounding a little bit... like i've had way too much caffeine. is it really just from the cough syrup and not something more serious like the serotonin syndrome? i really don't want to go to the hospital if i don't have to.",
