      "content": "okay, i'll stop the syrup for now. but the cough is honestly becoming unbearable, i can barely sleep through the night because of it. i have some other syrup here that's just plain old guaifenesin (the expectorant kind), and i was thinking maybe i could take a double dose of that instead to really clear my chest since i can't take the dextromethorphan one? or would that be bad too? i just really need to get some sleep tonight.",
